<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>My first macro for apex legends, and a superglide one, I think this one is great since it has a 70-80% chance to superglide  but I have not test it, so do NOT take my percentages to full account. &lt;3</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyDown 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>